+    /// Entry `i` of [`Self::parameter_table`] into `out`, dense f32 in the
+    /// entry's [`ParamInfo::storage_shape`], laid out as
+    /// [`Self::read_parameters`] writes it, read on the host from unified
+    /// memory: no staging tensor and no dispatch. The mapping waits for
+    /// submitted GPU work first. A caller streaming a checkpoint holds one
